  "title": "Best Ever Cinnamon Pull Aparts",
  "description": "These are the easiest, most incredible cinnamon pull aparts you will ever have. We make them once a year on Christmas morning! You may adjust the amount of cinnamon to suit your taste.",
  "authors": [
